    <string name="voice_model_kroko_detail">Banafo 的 Kroko ASR，CC BY-SA 4.0</string>
    <string name="voice_model_parakeet_small_detail">更轻更快，但更容易漏听名字。NVIDIA NeMo，CC BY 4.0</string>
    <string name="voice_model_canary_detail">推荐。速度快，能准确听出人名和地名。支持英语、西班牙语、德语和法语。NVIDIA NeMo，CC BY 4.0</string>
